      "inLanguage": "en",
      "description": "Seven Eighty Three, known as Lab 783, is an independent systems laboratory and venture foundry built from the mulch up. We apply principles of engineered nature (carrying capacity, closed-loop energy transfer, and self-regulating feedback loops) to construct physical supply chains, sovereign digital environments, and organizational infrastructure. Our practice operates across three core pillars: High-Density Diagnostics, Workflow & Systems Architecture, and Sovereign Infrastructure Design.",
